                              "fill": "#1a1f22",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 47,
                              "content": "Why choose a pellet sauna stove over electric or wood-burning?",
                              "fontFamily": "Work Sans",
                              "fontSize": 20,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "O0wrtw",
                              "name": "A pellet sauna stove offers the best of ",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#4a5258",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 163.17,
                              "content": "A pellet sauna stove offers the best of both worlds: the authentic warmth and ambiance of wood-fired heat without the hassle of chopping and storing firewood, and without the high electrical costs or installation requirements of electric heaters. Wood pellets are also more eco-friendly and cost-effective than other fuel sources.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.7,
                              "fontFamily": "Work Sans",
