                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 135.98,
                              "content": "The P1 pellet sauna stove heats your sauna to optimal temperature in approximately 30 minutes. This is comparable to electric heaters and faster than traditional wood-burning stoves, making it convenient for spontaneous sauna sessions.",
