                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#4a5258",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 108.78,
                              "content": "Many existing sauna rooms in the 300 to 500 cubic foot range may be candidates for a P1 retrofit. Final fit depends on room volume, clearances, venting path, floor protection, and the existing heater location.",
