                              "fill": "#4a5258",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 108.78,
                              "content": "Remote start lets you begin heating before you walk outside or arrive at the sauna. With the P1's approximately 30-minute heat-up time, that convenience can turn sauna use from a planned chore into a more spontaneous routine.",
