    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "xE1Vv",
      "x": 2534,
      "y": -1350,
      "name": "Dev Note — Hero Video",
      "width": 560,
      "height": 440,
      "content": "HERO BACKGROUND VIDEO\n\nThe hero background is a looping video. The image on the canvas is its poster frame.\n\nVideo: videos/p1-hero-loop.mp4 (1920×1080, 10.4s, 60fps, ~5 MB)\nPoster: images/hero/p1-hero-poster.jpg (frame at 0.87s)\n\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"p1-hero-poster.jpg\">\n\nLayout: hero is 960px tall on a #1E1C14 base. The video starts 80px from the top and 70px from the left (top: 80px; left: 70px; width: 100%; height: calc(100% - 80px); hero overflow: hidden), so the stove sits below the nav. Use object-fit: cover with object-position: 0% center. Dark fades hide the image's top and left edges.\n\nKeep the overlays from the design: dark left-to-right scrim behind the copy, lighter right scrim behind the stats, top band + bottom fade.\n\nFor production: re-encode to ~1–2 MB (H.264 + WebM, 1280–1920w, 24–30fps). Show the poster only for prefers-reduced-motion and on slow connections."
    },
