                      "content": "A pellet sauna stove is an innovative sauna heater that uses compressed wood pellets as fuel instead of traditional firewood or electricity. The P1 pellet sauna stove combines the authentic wood-fired sauna experience with modern convenience, offering precise temperature control and easy operation.",
